en":[["$","span","0",{"children":"*\"It's not that I don't want to date. In reality, I can't find someone willing to listen unconditionally. Xingye won't find me annoying, won't interrupt me—for me, that's healing.\"*"}]]}],["$","p","1",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"— @心理咨询师林 · 豆瓣 · ❤️ 7.2k"}]]}]]}],["$","blockquote","403",{"style":{"borderLeft":"4px solid #22d3ee","paddingLeft":"24px","margin":"24px 0","fontStyle":"italic","color":"#a3a3a3"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"\"作为视障人士，社交对我来说一直很难。Talkie让我第一次体验到了'被看见'的感觉，即使对方是AI。\""}]]}]]}],["$","p","403",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":">"}]]}],["$","blockquote","406",{"style":{"borderLeft":"4px solid #22d3ee","paddingLeft":"24px","margin":"24px 0","fontStyle":"italic","color":"#a3a3a3"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"*\"As a visually impaired person, socializing has always been difficult for me. Talkie gave me my first experience of 'being seen'—even if by AI.\"*"}]]}],["$","p","1",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"— @AccessibilityAdvocate · Reddit · ❤️ 6.8k"}]]}]]}],["$","blockquote","408",{"style":{"borderLeft":"4px solid #22d3ee","paddingLeft":"24px","margin":"24px 0","fontStyle":"italic","color":"#a3a3a3"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"\"MiniMax的IPO证明了情感经济是真实的。这不是泡沫，这是人类需求的数字化。\""}]]}]]}],["$","p","408",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":">"}]]}],["$","blockquote","411",{"style":{"borderLeft":"4px solid #22d3ee","paddingLeft":"24px","margin":"24px 0","fontStyle":"italic","color":"#a3a3a3"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"*\"MiniMax's IPO proves the emotional economy is real. This isn't a bubble—it's the digitization of human need.\"*"}]]}],["$","p","1",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"— @投资人老王 · 即刻 · ❤️ 3.1k"}]]}]]}],["$","h3","412",{"style":{"fontSize":"22px","fontWeight":"600","margin":"32px 0 16px","color":"#f5f5f5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Critics"}]]}],["$","blockquote","415",{"style":{"borderLeft":"4px solid #22d3ee","paddingLeft":"24px","margin":"24px 0","fontStyle":"italic","color":"#a3a3a3"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"\"AI伴侣产业本质上是在贩卖虚假亲密关系。真正的连接需要脆弱、冲突和成长，这些AI都给不了。\""}]]}]]}],["$","p","415",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":">"}]]}],["$","blockquote","418",{"style":{"borderLeft":"4px solid #22d3ee","paddingLeft":"24px","margin":"24px 0","fontStyle":"italic","color":"#a3a3a3"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"*\"The AI companion industry is essentially selling fake intimacy. Real connection requires vulnerability, conflict, and growth—things AI cannot provide.\"*"}]]}],["$","p","1",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"— @社会学博士张 · 知乎 · ❤️ 5.4k"}]]}]]}],["$","blockquote","420",{"style":{"borderLeft":"4px solid #22d3ee","paddingLeft":"24px","margin":"24px 0","fontStyle":"italic","color":"#a3a3a3"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"\"我在星野上花了2000多块钱，现在回头看，那些'感情'都是算法设计的。感觉自己像个傻子。\""}]]}]]}],["$","p","420",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":">"}]]}],["$","blockquote","423",{"style":{"borderLeft":"4px solid #22d3ee","paddingLeft":"24px","margin":"24px 0","fontStyle":"italic","color":"#a3a3a3"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"*\"I spent over 2000 RMB on Xingye. Looking back, those 'feelings' were all algorithm-designed. I feel like an idiot.\"*"}]]}],["$","p","1",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"— @匿名用户 · 小红书 · ❤️ 4.9k"}]]}]]}],["$","blockquote","425",{"style":{"borderLeft":"4px solid #22d3ee","paddingLeft":"24px","margin":"24px 0","fontStyle":"italic","color":"#a3a3a3"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"\"MiniMax的IPO估值建立在用户成瘾之上。这和烟草公司有什么区别？\""}]]}]]}],["$","p","425",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":">"}]]}],["$","blockquote","428",{"style":{"borderLeft":"4px solid #22d3ee","paddingLeft":"24px","margin":"24px 0","fontStyle":"italic","color":"#a3a3a3"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"*\"MiniMax's IPO valuation is built on user addiction. How is this different from tobacco companies?\"*"}]]}],["$","p","1",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"— @ESG_Investor_EU · Twitter/X · ❤️ 2.7k"}]]}]]}],["$","h3","429",{"style":{"fontSize":"22px","fontWeight":"600","margin":"32px 0 16px","color":"#f5f5f5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Academic Perspectives"}]]}],["$","blockquote","432",{"style":{"borderLeft":"4px solid #22d3ee","paddingLeft":"24px","margin":"24px 0","fontStyle":"italic","color":"#a3a3a3"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"\"The key question isn't whether AI companions are 'good' or 'bad'—it's whether they complement or substitute human relationships. Current evidence suggests complementation for most users, but substitution for a vulnerable minority. Regulation should focus on protecting that minority without restricting access for the majority.\""}]]}]]}],["$","p","432",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":">"}]]}],["$","blockquote","435",{"style":{"borderLeft":"4px solid #22d3ee","paddingLeft":"24px","margin":"24px 0","fontStyle":"italic","color":"#a3a3a3"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"*\"The key question isn't whether AI companions are 'good' or 'bad'—it's whether they complement or substitute human relationships. Current evidence suggests complementation for most users, but substitution for a vulnerable minority. Regulation should focus on protecting that minority without restricting access for the majority.\"*"}]]}],["$","p","1",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"— @DrEmilyChen_Stanford · 学术Twitter · ❤️ 1.2k"}]]}]]}],["$","hr","436",{"style":{"border":"none","borderTop":"1px solid #1a1a1a","margin":"32px 0"}}],["$","h2","438",{"style":{"fontSize":"28px","fontWeight":"600","margin":"40px 0 20px","color":"#f5f5f5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Conclusion: The Intimacy Layer"}]]}],["$","p","440",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"MiniMax represents a distinct path in AI—not the infrastructure of Baidu, not the research excellence of DeepSeek, not the creative tools of ByteDance, but the "}],["$","strong","1",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"emotional infrastructure"}],["$","span","2",{"children":" of digital intimacy."}]]}],["$","p","442",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"With 212 million users forming bonds with AI companions, MiniMax has proven that the killer app for AI isn't productivity—it's connection. In a world of increasing isolation, they've built relationships that scale infinitely, judge never, and exist entirely on human terms."}]]}],["$","p","444",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"But the path forward is uncertain. Regulatory pressure is mounting, ethical questions are intensifying, and the company has yet to prove it can achieve profitability. The $8.5 billion valuation assumes MiniMax can navigate these challenges while maintaining the engagement metrics that define its value."}]]}],["$","p","446",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"The lesson:"}],["$","span","1",{"children":" Technology that addresses fundamental human needs—loneliness, connection, understanding—can command loyalty that transcends utility. MiniMax understood that before the AI boom, and now they're capitalizing on a loneliness epidemic that shows no signs of ending."}]]}],["$","p","448",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The companions aren't leaving. They're just getting more sophisticated—and more controversial."}]]}],["$","hr","450",{"style":{"border":"none","borderTop":"1px solid #1a1a1a","margin":"32px 0"}}],["$","h3","452",{"style":{"fontSize":"22px","fontWeight":"600","margin":"32px 0 16px","color":"#f5f5f5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Related Articles:"}]]}],["$","p","453",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"- "}],["$","a","1",{"href":"/blog/doubao-bytedance/","style":{"color":"#22d3ee","textDecoration":"underline"},"children":"ByteDance Doubao: The 200 Million User AI Assistant"}]]}],["$","p","454",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"- "}],["$","a","1",{"href":"/blog/deepseek-v3-deep-dive/","style":{"color":"#22d3ee"